cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Coastline in academic work, please cite the MSc thesis
  (preferred-citation below). Cite this file when you need to refer to a
  specific released version of the software itself.
title: COASTLINE
abstract: >-
  Coastline is a context-aware recommender for GPU and datacenter
  configurations for LLM fine-tuning: given a workload it grid-searches
  configurations, filters infeasible ones, predicts throughput and power, and
  ranks the survivors on a performance-energy score.
type: software
